ts, the terraformer dungeons are partly fun and engaging - when not being a frustrating mess. You are forced to endure the EA App, a piece of adware that A. wastes PC ressources, B. causes various errors and conflicts and C. annoys you with little pop-ups: -10 to total score. Several unskippable cutscenes: -2 to total score.", "timestamp_created": 1790009687, "timestamp_updated": 1790408096, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.50205761194229126", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "hardware": {"system_ram": "16223", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 5700G with Radeon Graphics         ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Ti", "vram_size": 8017}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "235669417", "author": {"steamid": "76561198400428332", "personaname": "dodgehemi1991", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198400428332/", "num_games_owned": 104, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 650, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 206, "playtime_at_review": 115, "last_played": 1790390478, "avatar": "cd7a4992cd02093705310995647f0c33acbc8b8a"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like everything there is about Mass Effect Andromeda Deluxe Edition. I think that it's very fun and has very addictive gameplay to me!", "timestamp_created": 1789888507, "timestamp_updated": 1789888507, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.464238107204437256", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887420", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32671", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 9 5950X 16-Core Processor            ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeF